% ignite - oil it, then set it alight
%
% The recipe: ?e carries oiled (it is slicked, or pushed into an oil pool),
% then someone else lands burning on it. Note the trap the physics sets: if
% ?e is also wet, the first reaction that applies may be steam, not blaze.

% === Methods ===

ignite(?e) :- if(), do(combo(oiled, burning, ?e)).
